// 2.5: race entries every world's test zone can try ("Try another race" on the Race card), trimmed from the Re:Zero race book (V1.5 shapes)
const SANDBOX_RACE_EXTRA = [["**Identity Summary:**\nA slime is a living body of jelly with no bones, no organs anyone can point to, and no fixed shape. It flows, splits and joins again. (Test zone demo.)\n\n---\n[TAXONOMY & BASICS]\n---\nName: Slime\nClassification: Amorphous monster\nAverage Lifespan: Unknown\n\n---\n[ANATOMY & APPEARANCE]\n---\nPhysical Build:\nA rounded mass of translucent jelly about knee height, with a darker core.\n\nRacial Identifiers:\nNo bones, no limbs; a core that must not be cut.", ["Race: Slime", "Slime"], "Race: Slime"], ["**Identity Summary:**\nA spirit is a being of mana with no flesh. It is seen as light or a soft shape, and it is held to this world by a contract or a place. (Test zone demo.)\n\n---\n[TAXONOMY & BASICS]\n---\nName: Spirit\nClassification: Spirit (incorporeal)\nAverage Lifespan: As long as its mana lasts\n\n---\n[ANATOMY & APPEARANCE]\n---\nPhysical Build:\nNo body: a glow, or a borrowed shape that fades below the waist.\n\nRacial Identifiers:\nLight where a shadow should be; no footprints.", ["Race: Spirit", "Spirit"], "Race: Spirit"]];
